    {
      "text": "The wing panel, fuselage, tailplane and fin are all on the bed and fit a 220 x 220 x 250 mm build volume, but the printability check flags one problem: the wing's trailing edge is a 0 mm wall, thinner than the 0.4 mm nozzle, so it will not print as drawn. It needs a blunt trailing edge. Assumed, not given: the printer size, the span and the section; tell me if any is wrong."
